  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, near the Brazilian town of Varginha, where a craft is said to have crashed and a living creature to have been captured, a witness named Carlos de Souza says he was driving near the crash site when a military convoy came toward his car. He tells Michels on two shows that the army closed off the area, and on the second he adds that a soldier stepped back, \"raised his gun, cocked it, and pointed it at my head.\" If true, it would mean the Brazilian military moved fast to seal the site and keep witnesses away."
